'''Pablo's pawnshop''' was a shop in [[Bilbousa]] on the [[Hutt]] world of [[Nal Hutta]]. It was owned by the [[Rodian]] [[Pablo]], who sold [[weapon]]s and supplies to various criminal clientele.<ref name="FAE" /> The pawnshop was located in [[Bilbousa Bazaar]], the primary marketplace in the city of Bilbousa.<ref name="SWE">{{SWE|characters|pablo|Pablo}}</ref>

